回复 EN Answer:
There are several situations where the payment method cannot be selected. It is recommended to choose other payment methods:
1. The payment amount does not meet the limits of the payment method;
2. The payment method is under maintenance and cannot be used normally.

If you choose OVO payment, but it is not completed normally, there may be three reasons:
1. The entered mobile phone number is not registered in OVO or entered incorrectly. You can modify the mobile number on the input interface;
2. Didn’t open the OVO app within 55 seconds to complete the payment after entering the mobile phone number. It is recommended to initiate again and complete the payment;
3. Your transaction amount is too large and exceeds the OVO wallet limit, and the payment cannot be completed.

1. It will affect your personal credit score;
2. It will affect your credit investigation record in OJK;
3. It will affect your payment right on platform;

